Source: homelab-mailread
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/permittivity2/homelab-api

Package: homelab-mailread
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dovecot-core, dovecot-imapd, dovecot-lmtpd,
 dovecot-managesieved, dovecot-pgsql, postgresql-client, adduser
Description: Dovecot IMAP/LMTP/ManageSieve provisioning for Homelab mail
 Wires Dovecot's SQL passdb/userdb against dovecot.users, the homelab-api
 OAuth2 introspection passdb, Maildir storage, per-user quota, and Sieve
 against a PostgreSQL database -- via drop-in config files only, never
 editing any vendor-shipped Dovecot config. Targets Dovecot 2.3.x config
 syntax (matching current production); refuses cleanly on other major
 versions rather than writing config that won't parse.
